# Words after a lone year marker ("fin janvier dernier je suis parti") that
# open the next clause, so the marker closes the year phrase before them.
# Subject and object clitic pronouns, elided forms included, and the neuter
# demonstratives "ce", "c'", "ça". Source: Grevisse and Goosse, Le Bon Usage,
# the chapter on personal pronouns (pronoms personnels conjoints) and on
# demonstrative pronouns. "le", "la", "les" are also articles: before a noun
# ("dernier le dossier") the marker still closes the phrase, a known cost.
# Any other word after the marker may be the noun it qualifies ("dernier
# délai", "dernière minute"), and the marker is then left over.
je
j'
tu
il
elle
on
nous
vous
ils
elles
ce
c'
ça
y
en
me
m'
te
t'
se
s'
le
la
les
lui
leur
